38.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-left:8.25pt;text-align:center'><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=331 valign=top style='width:248.05pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:8.25pt;text-align:justify'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>&lt;500 ng\/ml (FEU)<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:16.5pt'>\r\n  <td width=210 valign=top style='width:157.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:8.25pt;text-align:justify'><span\r\n  lang=EN-US>IMMUNO-TURBIDIMETRY<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=185 valign=top style='width:138.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-left:8.25pt;text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=331 valign=top style='width:248.05pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:16.5pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:8.25pt;text-align:justify'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt'>TEST DONE IN ERBA ECL-105 SYSTEM.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>INRERPREATATION:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US>D-Dimer\r\ncontaining moieties are formed by plamin degradation of factor\r\nX13ateross-linked fibrin. Elevated<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US>level of\r\nD-Dimer is found in clinical conditions such as deep vein thrombosis. pulmonary\r\nembolism.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US>disseminated\r\nintravaseular coagulation. Laboratory measurement of fibrin degradation\r\nproducts. including d<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>dimer has both\r\ndiagnostic and proguostic significance in the initial assessment of these\r\nconditions.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>D-Dimer level is also elevated in renal, liver or\r\ncardiac tailure, pregnancy, imajor injury and surgery, severe<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>inflammatory conditions.. disseminated cancers and\r\nmonoclonal Gammopathies.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>For diagnostic purposes. the results should always be\r\nassessed in conjunction with patient's medical history.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>clinical examination and other findings<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span l